Package: QuantileGH
Type: Package
Title: Quantile Least Mahalanobis Distance Estimator for Tukey g-&-h
        Mixture
Version: 0.3.0
Date: 2026-07-16
Description: Functions for simulation, estimation, and model
  selection of finite mixtures of Tukey g-and-h
  distributions.  The author has retired from academic research. 
  Accordingly, this package should not be considered a validated tool 
  for use in peer-reviewed publications or as the basis for grant applications.  
  Backward compatibility with user-code published in 
  <doi:10.1007/s11222-025-10596-9> is not maintained in versions >= 0.3.0 (July 2026) of this package. The authors of those publications are the appropriate contacts for reproducibility inquiries. 
